---

interface Props {
  eyebrow?: string;
  ctaLabel?: string;
  ctaHref?: string;
  source?: string;
}
const {
  eyebrow = 'Website design & development · Atlanta',
  ctaLabel = 'Get a free site review',
  ctaHref = '#intake',
  source = 'hero',
} = Astro.props;
---

<section class="sales-hero page-intro container-page m3-hero"><div><p class="m3-eyebrow">{eyebrow}</p><h1>Websites that<br/>get you customers.</h1><p class="m3-lede">A clear offer, credible work and an obvious next step. One engineer scopes the site, builds it and hands over the code—without an agency layer in between.</p><div class="m3-actions"><a href={ctaHref} class="m3-button primary" data-cta="hero-review" data-section={source} data-intent="book:free-review">{ctaLabel} →</a><a href="#services" class="m3-link" data-cta="hero-packages" data-section={source}>See packages ↓</a></div><p class="m3-lede">2 min · No sales call</p></div><aside class="m3-manifesto" aria-label="Selected client evidence"><div><span>Client work</span><strong>Aries Outdoor Living</strong><p>Deployed and sold · first quote request 3 days after handoff.</p></div><div><span>Testing</span><strong>Big 7 Construction</strong><p>Test deployment built · waiting on real jobsite photography.</p></div><a class="m3-link" href="#proof" data-cta="hero-proof" data-section={source}>Read the case studies →</a></aside></section>
